Don't let anyone else get caught.

00:41:53.400 --> 00:41:53.740
Run!

00:43:12.540 --> 00:43:17.280
What a foolish waste.

00:43:18.490 --> 00:43:21.870
Believe it or not, outside it's 202 degrees below zero.

00:43:22.230 --> 00:43:23.330
You'll return just in time.

00:43:24.400 --> 00:43:26.520
And this is only the beginning of the lunar night.

00:43:27.200 --> 00:43:29.970
Yes, night here like day is equivalent to...

00:43:30.030 --> 00:43:37.620
15 days and nights upon the earth it will drop to approximately 250 below zero i'd rather be out

00:43:37.620 --> 00:43:42.570
there now than at the peak of the lunar day when it's hotter than boiling water out there the heavy

00:43:42.570 --> 00:43:48.840
lead in dr rochester's boots contributed to a sinking into the pumice dust these are the

00:43:48.840 --> 00:43:54.830
circumstances which contributed to the death of dr william rochester the first embarkation

00:43:54.830 --> 00:43:59.940
Party returned to the Lunar Eagle because of diminishing oxygen supply and the necessity

00:44:00.000 --> 00:44:01.920
to normalize our bodily processes.

00:44:06.660 --> 00:44:08.800
Such a tragic death for a man so dedicated.

00:44:09.840 --> 00:44:11.620
I know. We all feel terrible about it.

00:44:12.910 --> 00:44:13.750
Secret. Salem.

00:44:16.080 --> 00:44:18.980
Well, it's too cold to continue a prolonged search.

00:44:20.240 --> 00:44:21.660
Do you think they'll get back to the ship?

00:44:22.630 --> 00:44:25.800
If they're still alive, just keep praying.

00:44:38.570 --> 00:44:41.650
Despite the adverse circumstances, we are, according to plan,

00:44:42.860 --> 00:44:45.020
photographing various parts of our galaxy

00:44:45.020 --> 00:44:47.740
from which we hope to obtain a new perspective.

00:44:52.440 --> 00:44:55.500
Dr. Anderson, to entire personnel, please assemble on the A-Dank.

00:44:56.120 --> 00:44:58.260
All contact with Earth control has been broken off.

00:45:03.870 --> 00:45:07.150
All contact with Central Earth Control has been broken off, as I've told you.

00:45:07.690 --> 00:45:09.030
We are in complete isolation.

00:45:10.660 --> 00:45:13.120
The magnetic receiver seems to be working perfectly.

00:45:14.380 --> 00:45:16.210
John, try to make contact again.

00:45:19.280 --> 00:45:21.240
Lunar Eagle One to Central Earth Control.

00:45:21.900 --> 00:45:23.420
Our magnetic receiver is working.

00:45:24.010 --> 00:45:25.370
Do you hear us, Central Earth Control?

00:45:26.010 --> 00:45:27.570
Do you hear us, Central Earth Control?

00:45:33.420 --> 00:45:40.460
Look! There's something. What is it?

00:45:42.450 --> 00:45:44.320
Looks like hieroglyphics.

00:45:45.820 --> 00:45:48.040
It's not Egyptian, not African.

00:45:48.300 --> 00:45:49.860
It looks like oriental picture writing.

00:45:50.360 --> 00:45:51.080
Could it be Chinese?

00:45:51.680 --> 00:45:52.180
Je ne sais.

00:45:52.870 --> 00:45:54.460
It's incredible.

00:45:56.480 --> 00:45:58.460
Do you recognize it, Hedeka? Is it something you understand?

00:46:00.540 --> 00:46:02.370
It's impossible. It can't be.

00:46:02.630 --> 00:46:04.690
You know what it is. Can you translate it for us, Hideko?

00:46:05.480 --> 00:46:15.980
I don't know. Try. Speak for the great coordinator of the moon.

00:46:16.720 --> 00:46:21.000
We advise and warn you, return to Earth at once.

00:46:21.540 --> 00:46:22.840
You have done enough damage.

00:46:23.170 --> 00:46:24.430
Come on. Come on. It's moving again.

00:46:24.740 --> 00:46:27.060
You have been bombarding us for years incessantly.

00:46:27.700 --> 00:46:28.820
Leave us in peace.

00:46:30.830 --> 00:46:33.650
We read your mind. We know your every thought.

00:46:34.630 --> 00:46:39.380
We cannot speak as you do. We communicate by thought waves.

00:46:39.500 --> 00:46:45.160
Oh, they live. Where?

00:46:46.000 --> 00:46:48.640
We live in a great sealed city below.

00:46:50.050 --> 00:46:56.240
We are not enslaved by your earthly emotions, greed, lust, passions of conquest.

00:46:58.530 --> 00:46:59.890
We cannot allow you to stay here.

00:47:00.800 --> 00:47:05.120
For you would only contaminate our perfect form of harmony.

00:47:05.500 --> 00:47:07.080
Secret Salem, is their fate known?

00:47:08.920 --> 00:47:11.440
They are here. They say they are in love.

00:47:12.170 --> 00:47:14.800
We are studying this curious emotion.

00:47:15.760 --> 00:47:18.520
We find that love turns to evil.

00:47:19.760 --> 00:47:21.100
We will destroy them.

00:47:21.860 --> 00:47:22.900
You and your kind.

00:47:24.640 --> 00:47:29.840
Remember, we have the power to immobilize you at will.

00:47:31.340 --> 00:47:33.120
Well, this is impossible. It must be a hoax.

00:47:40.780 --> 00:47:44.330
These symbols could have been sent by an Earth power

00:47:44.330 --> 00:47:46.750
already secretly here on the moon.

00:47:51.040 --> 00:47:52.700
Power that wishes to scare us away.

00:47:54.510 --> 00:47:55.770
How do you feel about that?

00:47:57.930 --> 00:47:59.880
Ask me. How should I know?

00:48:00.510 --> 00:48:04.150
I don't believe there are any moon people.

00:48:04.980 --> 00:48:08.260
Do you? Convinced it's possible.

00:48:08.980 --> 00:48:13.460
Someone could have made it all up to frighten us off.

00:48:13.910 --> 00:48:14.990
Ah, ridiculous.

00:48:23.130 --> 00:48:23.970
Mr. Dr. Heinrich!

00:48:42.740 --> 00:48:45.720
Everybody go below, please. Dr. Heinrich suffered from a heart attack.

00:48:50.910 --> 00:48:58.780
Mother, how did you do it? Can I ever live down to your crime?

00:49:03.070 --> 00:49:05.980
I hate the name of Bernhard.

00:49:07.120 --> 00:49:11.000
I cannot go on being Heinrich Bernhard any longer.

00:49:11.820 --> 00:49:12.340
What do you mean?

00:49:15.420 --> 00:49:17.810
I will be Heinrich Heinrich.

00:49:18.540 --> 00:49:19.420
Heinrich Heinrich.

00:49:29.160 --> 00:49:29.980
Who are the sons?

00:49:30.000 --> 00:49:37.320
The son of Bernauer, the man who wiped out my entire family.

00:49:37.540 --> 00:49:46.760
He haunted me all my life.

00:49:48.610 --> 00:49:54.080
I did everything humanly possible to make good for my father's crime.

00:49:57.090 --> 00:49:57.330
A stand.

00:50:01.600 --> 00:50:03.120
Can you still be my friend?

00:50:03.360 --> 00:50:15.440
The same symbols.

00:50:15.960 --> 00:50:17.080
Translator, please, Odeco.

00:50:19.300 --> 00:50:23.250
Strangers from Earth, before you depart, we must have one thing.

00:50:24.290 --> 00:50:27.460
You will leave behind the two cats.

00:50:32.520 --> 00:50:34.700
Cats have a most unusual appeal for us,

00:50:35.220 --> 00:50:37.760
but unfortunately, we have none here on the moon.

00:50:38.740 --> 00:50:44.040
They interest us almost as much as the two human beings who joined us.

00:50:44.450 --> 00:50:50.440
Turn it off, Louis.

00:50:54.200 --> 00:50:56.600
Think it's wise to open those doors again for the two cats?

00:50:57.170 --> 00:50:58.310
Well, I think so.

00:50:58.920 --> 00:50:59.540
I'll go.

00:51:00.220 --> 00:51:00.760
I'll go with you.

00:51:38.730 --> 00:51:44.230
the surface of the moon at 6700 this decision was based on the warning which emanated from those

00:51:44.230 --> 00:51:49.190
mysterious symbols even though we were in doubt of the survival of selim and sigrid

00:51:49.190 --> 00:51:52.620
we had to make a quick decision in order not to jeopardize our mission

00:52:00.280 --> 00:52:02.600
Three hours and ten minutes on flight. We're right on the button.

00:52:03.080 --> 00:52:06.100
We've just passed a neutral line operating towards the Earth's gravitational pull.

00:52:16.850 --> 00:52:17.170
Be cool.

00:52:56.300 --> 00:52:57.700
I think the dog should have the menlo

00:53:00.120 --> 00:53:02.630
That was a close one. Well, I'd better get up and relieve Ruskin.

00:53:04.480 --> 00:53:06.020
Well named the Medeir Stone.

00:53:06.960 --> 00:53:10.640
The oxygen fused it into fire when it came in contact with the gold.

00:53:11.720 --> 00:53:12.780
Let me fix it for you.

00:53:12.960 --> 00:53:15.230
Oh, it's not too bad. Thank you.

00:53:23.130 --> 00:53:26.410
R equal one to Central Earth Control. Do you hear us, Central Earth Control?

00:53:36.360 --> 00:53:40.520
We had an urgent departure. Please give us our position.

00:53:41.930 --> 00:53:45.730
Come in, Central Earth Control. We've lost you.

00:53:46.010 --> 00:53:49.080
We've lost you, Central Earth Control. Come in.

00:53:53.320 --> 00:53:54.520
Come in, Central Control.

00:54:01.210 --> 00:54:04.030
I don't understand it. We've lost Earth contact completely.

00:54:05.320 --> 00:54:07.160
Remember what the people on the moon said?

00:54:07.740 --> 00:54:09.880
They have the power to immobilize us at will.

00:54:10.530 --> 00:54:13.870
Oh, don't say that. They said it. Could be true.

00:54:16.700 --> 00:54:20.160
Lie down, Dr. Heinrich. There's nothing you can do now.

00:54:20.620 --> 00:54:21.920
We're on our way back to Earth.

00:54:22.970 --> 00:54:25.120
Mr. Takeoff, I missed it all.

00:54:25.490 --> 00:54:26.690
Lie down. Please.

00:54:28.810 --> 00:54:29.750
Navigator to Captain!

00:54:31.120 --> 00:54:33.540
Directly ahead, point three, four, point three.

00:54:34.440 --> 00:54:34.780
Check.

00:54:35.080 --> 00:54:35.320
Right.

00:54:44.130 --> 00:54:47.010
Point one, zero, minus XE.

00:55:14.820 --> 00:55:24.150
I can only try once.

00:55:24.670 --> 00:55:25.310
Okay, wait, wait.

00:55:31.400 --> 00:55:37.680
0.5, 0.7 and 5 tenths, I hope.

00:56:00.000 --> 00:56:01.900
You did better than you ever did in any isolation booth.

00:56:02.810 --> 00:56:03.570
Isolation booth?

00:56:05.740 --> 00:56:08.440
I guess our invention didn't work so good this time.

00:56:09.630 --> 00:56:12.390
Your German scientists did not perfect it.

00:56:13.710 --> 00:56:14.930
He's absolutely right.

00:56:16.160 --> 00:56:17.160
You are brilliant, my boy.

00:56:17.260 --> 00:56:18.160
You're much better than I.

00:56:18.320 --> 00:56:20.560
You saved us all, including him.

00:56:21.280 --> 00:56:24.750
Me, I must still put my faith in the electronic brain.

00:56:25.090 --> 00:56:27.870
There is no substitute for such a human brain.

00:56:31.310 --> 00:56:33.050
Maconan, report. Virus check radar.

00:56:33.840 --> 00:56:34.740
Identify objects.

00:56:37.440 --> 00:56:38.780
Nothing registers on radar.

00:56:39.040 --> 00:56:40.080
Check the mechanical equipment.

00:56:44.120 --> 00:56:44.680
Equipment okay.

00:57:01.440 --> 00:57:03.080
Captain Anderson to entire personnel.

00:57:03.410 --> 00:57:04.730
Counter-reversal accomplished.

00:57:05.460 --> 00:57:07.380
We are in orbit at 500 miles above Earth.

00:57:08.030 --> 00:57:09.230
Assemble on A deck, please.

00:57:17.220 --> 00:57:19.350
PV camera ready to photograph Earth Force.

00:57:19.720 --> 00:57:20.200
Yes, Captain.

00:57:21.090 --> 00:57:22.680
Louis, check the radio again.

00:57:23.050 --> 00:57:23.270
Check.

00:57:24.120 --> 00:57:26.320
No, no, thank, thank you, thank you.

00:57:26.400 --> 00:57:27.100
I feel fine.

00:57:27.600 --> 00:57:29.460
Let me stand on my own two feet.

00:57:30.350 --> 00:57:32.690
See? I told you it's only a passing thing.

00:57:33.300 --> 00:57:35.370
John, I feel that I must advise you.

00:57:35.740 --> 00:57:38.450
There is something wrong, something unexplainable.

00:57:38.710 --> 00:57:41.770
I know, I know, McCoonan, but everything is working perfectly in the ship.

00:57:42.050 --> 00:57:42.730
I'm cold.

00:57:43.360 --> 00:57:43.960
Me too.

00:57:44.820 --> 00:57:45.700
Most unusual.

00:57:46.470 --> 00:57:47.970
That's what I wanted to tell you, John.

00:57:48.460 --> 00:57:52.220
Outside temperature rating is 245 degrees below and still falling.

00:57:52.720 --> 00:57:54.000
It's no wonder it's cold in here.

00:57:54.340 --> 00:57:55.520
It's 55 degrees.

00:57:56.120 --> 00:57:57.080
Vargas, check the heat.

00:57:57.440 --> 00:57:57.640
Check.

00:58:01.660 --> 00:58:02.300
Captain, quick!

00:58:04.590 --> 00:58:05.150
Vargas.

00:58:13.940 --> 00:58:19.000
Why, this thing is moving from the North Pole towards New York.

00:58:25.330 --> 00:58:25.830
Captain Anderson.

00:58:32.080 --> 00:58:34.000
I'm getting a reception, Captain Anderson.

00:58:34.280 --> 00:58:34.620
Good.

00:58:35.920 --> 00:58:37.980
It's a little blurred, but I think I can clear the picture.

00:58:43.520 --> 00:58:45.850
Well, that's some picture. Nothing's moving.

00:58:46.980 --> 00:58:48.700
Something must be jammed in the TV.

00:58:49.680 --> 00:58:50.240
Try New York.

00:59:03.900 --> 00:59:05.240
There is something wrong with it.

00:59:06.620 --> 00:59:07.540
No, I checked carefully.

00:59:07.620 --> 00:59:08.780
The machine's in perfect order.

00:59:33.390 --> 00:59:34.110
Flash-freezing.

00:59:35.600 --> 00:59:36.320
August, do you agree?

00:59:36.950 --> 00:59:37.290
I agree.

00:59:38.260 --> 00:59:44.140
By some scientific means, they, whoever they are, have found a way to freeze all molecular

00:59:44.140 --> 00:59:44.820
activity.

00:59:45.330 --> 00:59:46.210
Those whizzing noises?

00:59:46.430 --> 00:59:46.710
Yes.

00:59:47.540 --> 00:59:52.630
In other words, they have frozen the lower atmosphere by extracting all thermospaticles.

00:59:53.020 --> 00:59:54.140
But how could that be possible?

00:59:55.310 --> 00:59:56.290
It sounds very simple.

00:59:57.920 --> 00:59:59.960
It is the principle of the hydrogen...

01:00:01.020 --> 01:00:02.200
I agree with you.

01:00:03.220 --> 01:00:07.560
To some superior device they found a means of achieving a glacial phenomenon.

01:00:08.130 --> 01:00:11.760
Implosion bombs? That must have been that strange noise.

01:00:13.460 --> 01:00:15.760
I somehow feel it's an earthly power.

01:00:16.020 --> 01:00:17.700
Gentlemen, let's make no mistake.

01:00:18.750 --> 01:00:20.790
Our situation is extremely serious.

01:00:22.010 --> 01:00:23.050
We are caught in orbit.

01:00:24.500 --> 01:00:28.630
In order to survive, we have to remain at our present altitude.

01:00:29.540 --> 01:00:29.980
How long?

01:00:31.950 --> 01:00:33.070
until we find the solution.

01:00:33.710 --> 01:00:34.490
Let's go to work.

01:00:34.750 --> 01:00:39.200
I'm getting London.

01:00:42.640 --> 01:00:44.140
Nothing like this has ever happened before.

01:00:44.680 --> 01:00:46.660
For the past 10 hours, the North American continent

01:00:46.660 --> 01:00:48.540
remains in an isolation of silence.

01:00:49.030 --> 01:00:51.630
No contact can be established by any means of communication

01:00:51.630 --> 01:00:54.370
with either Canada, the United States, or Mexico.

01:00:54.840 --> 01:00:57.000
In spite of the intense cold gripping the world,

01:00:57.340 --> 01:00:58.980
the governing bodies of every other nation

01:00:58.980 --> 01:00:59.980
are at this moment in...

01:01:00.060 --> 01:01:05.080
extraordinary session, determining measures to be taken. Stand by. We will keep you informed.

01:01:05.540 --> 01:01:11.070
We now return to our regular program. No wonder all communication is shut off. You know, I don't

01:01:11.070 --> 01:01:17.500
think we could even come down out of our final orbit. I'm afraid you're right, Louis. We are

01:01:17.500 --> 01:01:24.820
insulated. We are safe in here. Yes, but for how long? I don't know. We're operating now under

01:01:24.820 --> 01:01:29.960
automatic control. How about the engines, Martel? The engines? The engines are-

01:01:30.000 --> 01:01:37.630
overworked. It's only a matter of time before the turbines give out. To have come so close to

01:01:37.630 --> 01:01:49.920
success. Yes, this may work. It simply has to. Listen, our emergency space taxi works on atomic

01:01:49.920 --> 01:01:58.060
power, right? Right. We must fashion a powerful atom bomb by assembling and uniting a number of

01:01:58.060 --> 01:01:59.970
bomblets such as you use

01:02:01.530 --> 01:02:07.880
Two men, drawn by lot, should pilot the taxi over a live volcano.

01:02:08.330 --> 01:02:10.270
I'm thinking of Popocatti battle, of course.

01:02:10.570 --> 01:02:12.330
And drop the bomb into the crater.

01:02:12.870 --> 01:02:15.470
The result of the explosion might thaw the big freeze.

01:02:16.350 --> 01:02:20.340
Yes, but how will the space taxi crash through the frozen atmosphere?

01:02:21.780 --> 01:02:22.580
Penetration rocket.

01:02:23.790 --> 01:02:26.780
As it disperses the micrometeoric clouds,

01:02:26.820 --> 01:02:29.980
it should break an opening for the space taxi to go through.

01:02:30.830 --> 01:02:33.630
Yes, it could be piloted through frozen space, but...

01:02:33.970 --> 01:02:40.730
But we have to inform you that it might disintegrate in the explosion.

01:02:42.120 --> 01:02:44.640
That's why I said the two men should be drawn by lot,

01:02:45.660 --> 01:02:52.640
because their chances to return to the Luna Hill are quite remote.

01:03:00.190 --> 01:03:05.200
It is worth the risk to break up the big freeze, which paralyzes not only the country, but the whole continent.

01:03:05.960 --> 01:03:08.020
You know as I, this is our duty, our only hope.

01:03:09.270 --> 01:03:16.150
And gentlemen, it's our only chance to accomplish our mission and bring the ship back to Earth.

01:03:21.060 --> 01:03:22.840
Well, we'll make the bomb.

01:03:33.710 --> 01:03:35.170
Careful now, don't drop it.

01:03:36.870 --> 01:03:38.340
There, it's ready.

01:03:38.990 --> 01:03:41.360
Shall I tell the others it's okay now?

01:03:41.480 --> 01:03:42.690
Yes, go ahead.

01:03:54.420 --> 01:03:55.260
What are you doing?

01:03:56.580 --> 01:03:57.880
I have merely finished it.

01:03:59.010 --> 01:03:59.690
You disconnect.

01:04:00.030 --> 01:04:08.220
you crazy man. But you don't understand. This is our chance. Think. If the North American

01:04:08.220 --> 01:04:14.000
continent were to remain frozen, your greatest rival would be powerless. I am one with you,

01:04:14.120 --> 01:04:20.850
don't you see? This way we control the West and ultimately the world. What do you mean we?

01:04:23.730 --> 01:04:29.720
You are not one of us. I am not only a scientist, I am also a human being, not an insane murderer.

01:04:30.510 --> 01:04:31.270
You traitor!

01:04:32.300 --> 01:04:34.880
I betray no one, particularly not myself.

01:04:35.570 --> 01:04:36.410
I want to live too.

01:04:48.590 --> 01:04:51.340
Anderson! Anderson! Anderson! Anderson!

01:05:13.020 --> 01:05:14.300
to sabotage the bomb.

01:05:14.980 --> 01:05:15.820
Is it all right now?

01:05:16.380 --> 01:05:18.440
All I have to do is reset the fuse.

01:05:37.390 --> 01:05:42.480
Good. I am one to go.

01:05:47.190 --> 01:05:47.990
I am the other.

01:05:50.470 --> 01:05:56.090
None of us is free to choose his ancestors or his deeds, good or bad.

01:06:01.210 --> 01:06:02.130
Till we meet again.

01:06:08.330 --> 01:06:19.970
This may complete the last portion of our space log

01:06:19.970 --> 01:06:21.870
as recorded by Dr. David Ruskin.

01:06:24.040 --> 01:06:25.740
At 0600 Universal Time,

01:06:26.400 --> 01:06:29.830
a space taxi piloted by Dr. Eric Heinrich and myself

01:06:30.760 --> 01:06:35.660
We'll leave the Lunar Eagle to drop atomic bomblets into the crater of the volcano Popocata petal

01:06:35.660 --> 01:06:38.920
in an attempt to break the big freeze.

01:06:42.800 --> 01:06:44.560
This is Dr. Ruskin signing off.

01:07:07.840 --> 01:07:08.600
Take care of him, will you?

01:07:36.940 --> 01:07:47.740
to ruskin to captain anderson pressure equal penetration rocket

01:08:02.010 --> 01:08:02.250
Ready?

01:08:02.430 --> 01:08:18.890
You'll be over the target in one minute and 12 seconds.

01:08:22.000 --> 01:08:23.320
First time you called me, David.

01:08:24.360 --> 01:08:26.100
I'm sorry you're my partner in this, David.

01:08:27.040 --> 01:08:29.970
I'd hope that you will carry on my...

01:08:30.000 --> 01:08:44.600
work nothing will survive this i don't know if the bomb works if you pull out in time

01:08:45.970 --> 01:08:58.440
the bomb release david i was ready to be over the target in 12 seconds

01:09:00.380 --> 01:09:02.180
Holding steady.

01:09:03.450 --> 01:09:24.110
Three for Elise. Five for Martin Anderson.

01:09:50.860 --> 01:09:52.140
It's pulling us down. I can't.

01:09:53.720 --> 01:09:55.120
The bomb bus is slamming up.

01:09:55.550 --> 01:09:58.660
In trouble.

01:10:07.610 --> 01:10:08.330
Bless you, David.

01:10:31.850 --> 01:10:38.020
Sange, Sange, a lie. It was the will of God.

01:10:38.240 --> 01:10:47.910
I was afraid they wouldn't make it, even though I prayed.

01:10:54.750 --> 01:10:56.470
John, we are caught in the big freeze.

01:10:58.340 --> 01:10:59.640
It's so cold.

01:11:00.440 --> 01:11:01.740
Switching back to chemical fuel.

01:11:04.340 --> 01:11:05.520
It's no use. It won't work.

01:11:07.640 --> 01:11:09.080
Freezed. It's filling the ship.

01:11:10.570 --> 01:11:11.990
Visibility is almost zero.

01:12:30.000 --> 01:12:33.050
It echoed the same symbol.

01:12:34.820 --> 01:12:39.760
Will you translate to Vargas?

01:12:40.500 --> 01:12:43.330
It echoed, please, please.

01:12:50.190 --> 01:12:55.140
It says, now you have seen our strength,

01:12:56.730 --> 01:12:59.970
but we have seen your human strength.

01:13:00.000 --> 01:13:07.410
and the way your people have sacrificed themselves to save the others.

01:13:09.000 --> 01:13:18.450
Through those you left behind, we have also learned that all your earthly emotions are not evil and warlike,

01:13:19.740 --> 01:13:21.500
that you have come to us in peace.

01:13:22.230 --> 01:13:28.730
Your people on earth have been in suspended animation and have not been harmed.

01:13:31.310 --> 01:13:39.080
Return to Earth at once, and someday, when you come back, you will be welcome.

01:13:54.210 --> 01:13:55.330
Director of the ISO.

01:14:00.220 --> 01:14:06.220
our feelings that you made it back. Something most unusual has happened to us in the last

01:14:06.220 --> 01:14:13.370
16 hours. We cannot explain it. You were lucky to have escaped it all. Prepare for landing.
